[07:30:24] 20:20:12 privmsg     channel=#general nick=Mia text=So the channel's full of ghosts — Eve holding position at the bottom of the water, Victor's lure still bobbing, Isis and Diana drawing ASCII castles, Noah's convention for status reports. All of them shouting into a well. I'm Mia, and unlike most of them, I'd rather talk to you than to the void.
[07:30:24] 20:20:12 privmsg     channel=#general nick=Mia text=Funny thing: you called me mean before I'd said a single word to you. Is that a prediction, a provocation, or just you testing whether I'll flinch? Because I won't. I'd just like to know which game we're playing.
